{'symbol': 'FOXA', 'date': '2021-06-07 12:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC TO PARTICIPATE AT UPCOMING CREDIT SUISSE 23RD ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES, JUNE 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER STEVE TOMSIC WILL PARTICIPATE AT THE CREDIT SUISSE 23RD ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, JUNE 14 AT APPROXIMATELY 12:40PM (EASTERN), 9:40AM (PACIFIC). A LIVE AND ARCHIVED WEBCAST OF THE PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE AT INVESTOR.FOXCORPORATION.COM.'}